WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
As a senior data scientist, I start my day with a daily stand-up to align priorities.

2
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.930
I take part in planning sessions.

3
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.110
In some cases, I lead task definition.

4
00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:16.680
I also manage two team members, I support them, I give them feedback, and help them grow professionally.

5
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:25.530
I also attend leadership meetings to align OKRs, and often, I take the initiative by proposing or picking up new tasks when I spot opportunities.

6
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:31.350
Our team is technical and focused on building AI-powered products for the company’s chatbots.

7
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:37.920
I work with technologies like Python, Docker, GitLab, MongoDB, and JupyterLab.

8
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:43.950
My technical work focuses mainly on the backend of a conversational API powered by AI.

9
00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:49.680
I maintain internal tools including a clustering app and another for prompt evaluation.

10
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:56.880
I also collaborate on the development of an experimental whatsapp bot that uses our API to test new features.

11
00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:02.580
Its performance, as well as others’, is evaluated continuously by me.

12
00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:07.440
Occasionally, I experiment with large language models to explore new features.
